---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="機密ファイル安心処理ツール群｜外部送信なし・ブラウザ完結 - ZeroLeak Tools"
  description="登録不要・完全無料。給与明細PDFパスワード解除、個人情報CSV伏字化、写真EXIF削除など、ファイルを外部サーバーへ一切送信せずにお使いの端末内だけで高速安全に処理します。"
  canonicalPath="/"
>
  <div class="space-y-8 sm:space-y-16 py-2 sm:py-4">

    <!-- ヒーローセクション（清潔感ある白基調・重複表現を完全排除・スマホ見切れ防止） -->
    <section class="text-center space-y-3 sm:space-y-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto pt-1 sm:pt-2 px-2 sm:px-4">
      <!-- 統合された唯一のピルバッジ -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200/80 text-slate-700 text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-semibold shadow-xs">
        <span class="inline-block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-ping"></span>
        <span>完全無料 • インストール不要 • オフライン動作対応</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-snug sm:leading-tight px-2 sm:px-0">
        <span class="sm:hidden">機密ファイルを1バイトも<br />送信しない 安心ツール</span>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline">機密ファイルを1バイトも送信しない、<br />安心のローカル業務ツール</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-0">
        給与明細・マイナンバー・顧客データ・社外秘ファイルを、外部へ一切アップロードせずブラウザ内だけで安全に高速処理します。
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- ツール一覧セクション（クリッカブルなカード群） -->
    <section class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-6">
      <div class="text-center space-y-1">
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">ツール一覧</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500">
          インストール・会員登録不要。すべてブラウザ内だけで安全にご利用いただけます。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- クリッカブル・ツールカード グリッド（白基調・金融SaaS風） -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        
        <!-- ツール1: CSVマスキング -->
        <a
          href="/csv-masking/"
          class="group flex flex-col justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-500 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer w-full overflow-hidden"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-2.5">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-200 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold">
                完全無料・瞬時処理
              </span>
              <span class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform flex items-center gap-0.5">
                開く ➔
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 mb-1.5">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center text-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shrink-0">
                📄
              </div>
              <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors leading-snug">
                  CSV・テキスト 個人情報＆マイナンバー 自動マスキング
                </h3>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 truncate">社内テスト環境・社外ベンダー提出用</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 視覚的 Before ➔ After ミニUIプレビュー -->
            <div class="my-3 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] space-y-1.5 select-none">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[9px] text-slate-400 font-sans px-1 pb-1 border-b border-slate-200/60">
                <span>元の生データ (個人情報)</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-700 font-semibold flex items-center gap-0.5"><span>✓</span> 安全な伏字</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-1.5 p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-2xs">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 truncate text-slate-600">
                  <span class="text-[9px] px-1 py-0.2 rounded bg-rose-50 text-rose-600 border border-rose-200 font-sans font-medium">氏名</span>
                  <span class="line-through text-slate-400 text-[10px]">佐藤 健一</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-slate-300">➔</span>
                <div class="font-bold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-200 shrink-0 text-[10px]">
                  佐***
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-1.5 p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-2xs">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 truncate text-slate-600">
                  <span class="text-[9px] px-1 py-0.2 rounded bg-rose-50 text-rose-600 border border-rose-200 font-sans font-medium">番号</span>
                  <span class="line-through text-slate-400 text-[10px]">1234-5678-9012</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-slate-300">➔</span>
                <div class="font-bold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-200 shrink-0 text-[10px]">
                  ****-****-9012
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2.5 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] text-slate-400">登録不要・即座にCSVダウンロード</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-emerald-700 group-hover:underline flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] sm:text-xs">
              ツールを使う ➔
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- ツール2: PDFパスワード解除 -->
        <a
          href="/pdf-unlock/"
          class="group flex flex-col justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-teal-500 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer w-full overflow-hidden"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-2.5">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-teal-50 text-teal-800 border border-teal-200 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold">
                完全無料・300DPI
              </span>
              <span class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-teal-700 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform flex items-center gap-0.5">
                開く ➔
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 mb-1.5">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-teal-50 border border-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center text-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shrink-0">
                🔓
              </div>
              <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-teal-700 transition-colors leading-snug">
                  給与明細・機密PDF パスワード解除＆メタデータ削除
                </h3>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5 truncate">住宅ローン審査・確定申告(e-Tax)・社外提出用</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 視覚的 Before ➔ After ミニUIプレビュー -->
            <div class="my-3 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] select-none">
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                <!-- Before -->
                <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-white border border-rose-200/80 shadow-2xs space-y-1">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-rose-600 text-[10px] font-bold">
                    <span>🔒 パスワード保護</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="p-1 rounded bg-rose-50/70 border border-rose-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div class="flex gap-0.5">
                      <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-rose-400"></span>
                      <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-rose-400"></span>
                      <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-rose-400"></span>
                      <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-rose-400"></span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-[8px] text-rose-500 font-bold">提出不可</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 truncate">給与明細_2026.pdf</div>
                </div>
                <!-- After -->
                <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-white border border-teal-300 shadow-2xs space-y-1">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-teal-700 text-[10px] font-bold">
                    <span>🔓 解除済みクリーンPDF</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="p-1 rounded bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-teal-800">閲覧・提出OK</span>
                    <span class="text-[8px] px-1 py-0.2 rounded bg-teal-200/60 text-teal-900 font-mono">300DPI</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-[9px] text-teal-600 truncate font-medium">✓ 作成者履歴も完全抹消</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2.5 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] text-slate-400">登録不要・住宅ローンやe-Taxに最適</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-teal-700 group-hover:underline flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] sm:text-xs">
              ツールを使う ➔
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- ツール3: 写真EXIF・GPS位置情報一括削除 -->
        <a
          href="/exif-remover/"
          class="group flex flex-col justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-cyan-600 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer w-full overflow-hidden"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-2.5">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-800 border border-cyan-200 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold">
                完全無料・100枚一括
              </span>
              <span class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-cyan-700 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform flex items-center gap-0.5">
                開く ➔
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 mb-1.5">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-50 border border-cyan-100 flex items-center justify-center text-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shrink-0">
                📍
              </div>
              <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-cyan-700 transition-colors leading-snug">
                  写真 位置情報（EXIF・GPS）一括削除
                </h3>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5 truncate">現場写真共有・ブログ掲載・自宅特定防止用</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 視覚的 Before ➔ After ミニUIプレビュー -->
            <div class="my-3 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] select-none">
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                <!-- Before -->
                <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-white border border-amber-200/80 shadow-2xs space-y-1">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-800 text-[10px] font-bold truncate">
                    <span>📍 自宅・撮影場所</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="p-1 rounded bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200 text-[9px] space-y-0.5 text-slate-600">
                    <div class="text-rose-600 font-medium truncate text-[9px]">北緯35°/東経139°</div>
                    <div class="text-slate-400 truncate text-[8px]">iPhone 15 Pro / 撮影日時</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <!-- After -->
                <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-white border border-cyan-300 shadow-2xs space-y-1">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-cyan-800 text-[10px] font-bold">
                    <span>🛡️ 位置情報を完全抹消</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="p-1 rounded bg-cyan-50 border border-cyan-200 text-[9px] space-y-0.5 text-cyan-950 font-medium">
                    <div class="text-cyan-700 font-bold text-[9px]">✓ 位置情報 0件 (安全)</div>
                    <div class="text-slate-500 text-[8px]">画質劣化なし・ZIP出力</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2.5 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] text-slate-400">ドラッグ＆ドロップで一括ZIP保存</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-cyan-700 group-hover:underline flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] sm:text-xs">
              ツールを使う ➔
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- ツール4: 画像 顔・ナンバー・機密箇所ブラウザ内モザイク＆黒塗り -->
        <a
          href="/local-mosaic/"
          class="group flex flex-col justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-indigo-500 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer w-full overflow-hidden"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-2.5">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-800 border border-indigo-200 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold">
                完全無料・不可逆処理
              </span>
              <span class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform flex items-center gap-0.5">
                開く ➔
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 mb-1.5">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center text-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shrink-0">
                🕶️
              </div>
              <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-700 transition-colors leading-snug">
                  画像 顔・ナンバー・機密箇所 モザイク＆黒塗り
                </h3>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5 truncate">社内管理画面スクショ・手順書・現場写真用</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 視覚的 Before ➔ After ミニUIプレビュー -->
            <div class="my-3 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] select-none">
              <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-white border border-indigo-200/80 shadow-2xs space-y-1.5">
                <!-- ミニブラウザ風バー -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 pb-1 border-b border-slate-100 text-[9px] text-slate-400">
                  <div class="flex gap-1">
                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-300"></span>
                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-300"></span>
                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-300"></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex-1 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-slate-400 text-[8px] truncate">https://admin.internal/user/102</span>
                    <span class="px-1 bg-slate-900 text-[8px] text-white rounded font-mono font-bold shrink-0">黒塗り</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <!-- ミニ画面コンテンツ -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5 pt-0.5">
                  <div class="p-1.5 rounded bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-[9px] text-slate-500">顧客名・売上</span>
                    <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-slate-900 text-white text-[8px] font-mono rounded">REDACTED</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="p-1.5 rounded bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-[9px] text-slate-500">顔・車両写真</span>
                    <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 text-[8px] font-bold rounded border border-indigo-200 flex items-center gap-0.5">
                      <span class="w-2 h-2 inline-block bg-[radial-gradient(#4338ca_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:2px_2px]"></span>
                      モザイク
                    </span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2.5 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] text-slate-400">Ctrl+V貼付・複数枚一括処理</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-indigo-700 group-hover:underline flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] sm:text-xs">
              ツールを使う ➔
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- ツール5: 社外秘音声の文字起こし＆個人情報マスク -->
        <a
          href="/local-whisper/"
          class="group flex flex-col justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-purple-500 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer w-full overflow-hidden"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-2.5">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-purple-50 text-purple-800 border border-purple-200 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold">
                完全無料・TXT/SRT/VTT
              </span>
              <span class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-purple-700 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform flex items-center gap-0.5">
                開く ➔
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 mb-1.5">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-50 border border-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center text-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shrink-0">
                🎙️
              </div>
              <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-purple-700 transition-colors leading-snug">
                  社外秘音声の文字起こし ＆ 個人情報マスク
                </h3>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5 truncate">経営会議・人事1on1・NDA商談議事録用</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 視覚的 Before ➔ After ミニUIプレビュー -->
            <div class="my-3 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] select-none">
              <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-white border border-purple-200/80 shadow-2xs space-y-1.5">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[9px]">
                  <span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-purple-800 font-bold font-mono">
                    <span>🎙️ 役員会議_録音.wav</span>
                  </span>
                  <!-- ミニ波形バー -->
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-0.5 h-3">
                    <span class="w-0.5 h-1.5 bg-purple-300 rounded-full"></span>
                    <span class="w-0.5 h-3 bg-purple-500 rounded-full"></span>
                    <span class="w-0.5 h-2 bg-purple-400 rounded-full"></span>
                    <span class="w-0.5 h-2.5 bg-purple-600 rounded-full"></span>
                    <span class="w-0.5 h-1 bg-purple-300 rounded-full"></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-1.5 rounded bg-purple-50/60 border border-purple-100 font-mono text-[9px] space-y-0.5 text-slate-700">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">[00:15]</span>
                    <span class="truncate">新単価は49,800円、連絡先は</span>
                    <span class="px-1 rounded bg-purple-200/80 text-purple-900 font-semibold shrink-0 text-[8px]">[電話番号伏字]</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2.5 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] text-slate-400">外部クラウド送信なし・字幕/TXT出力</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-purple-700 group-hover:underline flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] sm:text-xs">
              ツールを使う ➔
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- ツール6: AIプロンプト 機密サニタイザー -->
        <a
          href="/ai-prompt-sanitizer/"
          class="group flex flex-col justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-500 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer w-full overflow-hidden"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-2.5">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 border border-amber-200 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold">
                AIへの機密漏洩防止 • 実名復元付き
              </span>
              <span class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform flex items-center gap-0.5">
                開く ➔
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 mb-1.5">
